      "rule": "Same cascade bug as beaux-arts-french: this slot is wrongly forbidden by the vernacular family spliced in via the near-symmetrical/vernacular french-manoir hybridization edge on french-renaissance-chateau. Corrected here: a giant order spanning the two principal storeys, or coupled columns, correctly proportioned per Perrault's own Ordonnance (1683).",
      "sources": [
